HRĪ, Ⅲ. P. jihreti, be ashamed of any 🞄one (g.) or anything (ab.): pp. hrīta, ashamed, 🞄embarrassed, bashful;
 hrīṇa (rare), id.;
 cs. 🞄hrepaya, P. make ashamed, cause to blush, 🞄put to shame (also fig. = surpass);
 intv. jahrīyate, be greatly ashamed.

hrī-pada, n. cause of shame;
 -bhaya, 🞄n. fear of shame;
 -mat, a. embarrassed, bashful;
 🞄ashamed;
 -mūḍha, pp. bewildered with 🞄shame.
